{{For|the Old Wolfs on {{Gamemode|Stranded}}|Old Wolf (Stranded)}}
The '''Old Wolf''' is a stronger version of the [[Wolf]] with {{hp| 15,000}}, found in specific areas of the [[Ruins]], namely the Throne Room, in the chamber below the Throne Room, behind the [[Ruins]] to the west, as well as on the balcony of the [[Lonely Philosopher]]'s tower.

